; Simplest valid beancount: open two accounts, post one balanced
; transaction. The narration ("Opening payroll") becomes our Entry.Payee.
;
; See: beancount.github.io/docs/beancount_language_syntax.html

2024-01-01 open Assets:US:BofA:Checking USD
2024-01-01 open Income:Salary USD

2024-01-15 * "Acme Corp" "Opening payroll"
  Assets:US:BofA:Checking          1000.00 USD
  Income:Salary                   -1000.00 USD
